@* <summary>Seção pública do AdMetricsPro, preservando a composição e as interações da referência.</summary> *@
<footer class="relative z-10 w-full py-space-3xl px-gutter-mobile lg:px-gutter bg-surface-container-lowest/80">
    <div class="max-w-[1200px] mx-auto flex flex-col gap-space-2xl">
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-5 gap-space-xl">
            <!-- Coluna Marca -->
            <div class="lg:col-span-2 flex flex-col items-start gap-space-sm">
                <div class="flex items-center gap-space-sm">
                    <img alt="AdMetricsPro" class="h-8 w-auto object-contain" src="images/landing/brand-mark.svg" />
                    <span class="font-headline-card text-headline-card text-on-surface font-bold tracking-tight">AdMetricsPro</span>
                </div>
                <p class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant max-w-[340px]">
                    Análise multicanal, criativos e controle de orçamento para quem precisa transformar dados de mídia em decisões.
                </p>
            </div>

            <!-- Coluna Produto -->
            <div class="flex flex-col gap-space-xs text-body-sm">
                <span class="font-mono-code text-[12px] font-bold text-on-surface uppercase mb-space-xs">Produto</span>
                <a class="text-on-surface-variant hover:text-on-surface transition-colors" href="#hero">Visão do Produto</a>
                <a class="text-on-surface-variant hover:text-on-surface transition-colors" href="#como-funciona">Como Funciona</a>
                <a class="text-on-surface-variant hover:text-on-surface transition-colors" href="#recursos">Recursos</a>
                <a class="text-on-surface-variant hover:text-on-surface transition-colors" href="#para-quem">Para Quem É</a>
            </div>

            <!-- Coluna Plataforma -->
            <div class="flex flex-col gap-space-xs text-body-sm">
                <span class="font-mono-code text-[12px] font-bold text-on-surface uppercase mb-space-xs">Plataforma</span>
                <a class="text-on-surface-variant hover:text-on-surface transition-colors" href="#planos">Planos e Preços</a>
                <a class="text-on-surface-variant hover:text-on-surface transition-colors" href="/login">Acessar Conta</a>
                <a class="text-on-surface-variant hover:text-on-surface transition-colors" href="#faq">FAQ</a>
                <a class="text-on-surface-variant hover:text-on-surface transition-colors" href="/onboarding">Começar Teste Grátis</a>
            </div>

            <!-- Coluna Ajuda e Confiança -->
            <div class="flex flex-col gap-space-xs text-body-sm">
                <span class="font-mono-code text-[12px] font-bold text-on-surface uppercase mb-space-xs">Ajuda e Confiança</span>
                <a class="text-on-surface-variant hover:text-on-surface transition-colors" href="#seguranca">Segurança e Governança</a>
                <a class="text-on-surface-variant hover:text-on-surface transition-colors" href="#faq">Dúvidas Frequentes</a>
                <a class="text-on-surface-variant hover:text-on-surface transition-colors" href="/onboarding">Criar minha conta</a>
                <span class="text-outline text-[12px]">Teste por 14 dias sem cartão</span>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Copyright Rodapé -->
        <div class="pt-space-lg flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-between text-body-sm text-outline gap-space-sm">
            <span>© @DateTime.UtcNow.Year AdMetricsPro. Todos os direitos reservados.</span>
            <span class="font-mono-code text-[11px]">Gestão Unificada de Tráfego Pago</span>
        </div>
    </div>
</footer>
